  * bl-pgpid certify: the legacy fallback was selecting revoked uids too
  * bl-pgpid: give the primary-user-id flag back to the main address
  * bl-pgpid email: keep an address as the main identity after a revocation
  * tests: read the uid index back instead of hardcoding it in the T6 fixture
  * docs: turn the implementation notes into bash-libs-implementation(7)
